<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27818" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόγμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοκέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which seems to one,
			opinion</i> or <i>belief,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				538c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πόλεως κοινόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					644d
				</span></i>
			, etc.; esp. of philosophical <i>doctrines,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				14.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.204
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>notion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				158d
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>decision, judgement,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				926d
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>public decree, ordinance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				And.
				4.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν Ἀμφικτυόνων δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					5.19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18.154
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόγμα ποιήσασθαι,</span> c.
				inf., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.3.5
			</span></i>; esp. of Roman <i>Senatus-consulta,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. συγκλήτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.13.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).173.22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῆς βουλῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					8.87
				</span></i>
			.</div>
